			Special: {
				Fireball: Fireball|Shoots a fireball condensed by magic
				Incinerating: Incinerating|Makes targets on fire, and generates a fire explosion, dealing {0} AoE magic damage
				Scorching: Scorching|Applys [{$Mods.CNC.Buff.Name.Scorched}] to targets when strikes, decreasing target's defense by {0}
				Enthusiasm: Enthusiasm|{0} chance to trigger [{$Mods.CNC.Buff.Name.Enthused}] when you attack
				Gelidity: Gelidity|Reduces target's movement speed
				Glacier: Glacier|Your attacks may freeze your targets when strikes
				Iceflake: Iceflake|Generates an extra explosion, and deals {0} AoE magic damage
				Shattering: Shattering|冰弹对冻结的敌人造成的魔法伤害增加{0}
				FrostWave: Frost Wave|右键每秒消耗{0}点魔力不断构建扩张性的寒气，你半径{1}格内的敌人将持续减速且受到{2}s冻结，被冻结的目标一段时间内不会再被冻结
				Charging: Charging|Shoots a lightning missile
				SpellLightningChain: Spell Lightning Chain|Right click to shoot a lightning chain, and attacks {0} targets, dealing {1} magic damage
				ArcaneOverload: ArcaneOverload|Increases magic damage by {0} when strikes targets, it will be cleared when increased to {1}, and shoots a overloaded missile next time, dealing {2} AoE magic damage {3} times;
				SpellReconstruction: Spell Reconstruction|Attacks have a {0} chance to instantly rebuild and cast the Spell Chain Lightning charm
				SpellAugmentated: Spell Augmentated|Improved spell research to increase chain lightning target by {0} and search radius by {1}
				StableSpell: Stable Spell|Overload will be able to hold for {0}s
				SilveryArrow: Silvery Arrow|Wooden arrows turn into Silvery Arrows
				Sanctity: Sanctity|{0} shoots an Sanctified Arrow, making {1} ranged damage and applying [{$Mods.CNC.Buff.Name.Sanctified}] to targets
				Exorcism: Exorcism|Explodes all Sanctified Arrows if the target was struck by {0} Sanctified Arrows, dealing {1} ranged damage
				SilveryFlame: Silvery Flame|污秽之物将被银白圣树的力量烧灼，造成一定的持续伤害
				Judgement: Judgement|攻击有概率造成{0}的额外魔法伤害
				SilveryShield: Silvery Shield|每造成{0}次伤害，获得持续{1}s充满神圣能量的护盾，抵挡{2}点伤害，被击破或持续时间结束后爆炸造成{3}点范围魔法伤害
				SilveryVow: Silvery Vow|右键消耗{0}点神力值，获得持续{1}s的神圣护盾，期间所受伤害减免{2}，神圣惩戒触发概率提高{3}，每次触发神圣惩戒效果获得{4}护盾值
				Rock: Rock|使用远古埃兹西亚咒文吟唱，从地面抬起巨岩掷向对手，造成{0}魔法伤害并产生极强击退
				ActiveChant: Active Chant|你不再需要完全专注于吟唱，将能以缓慢移动进行施法
				Fragmentation: Fragmentation|向岩石中注入庞大魔力，岩石击中敌人时将爆炸并产生{0}范围魔法伤害
				DizzyStrike: Dizzy Strike|攻击有{0}概率使得除Boss以外的敌人晕眩，无法移动{1}s
				EmberPrayer: Ember Prayer|消耗{0}点神力值使用信仰之力，构筑起一道持续{1}秒的符文防御屏障，任何接近你的攻击将熔化
				EmberOath: Ember Oath|右键消耗{0}点神力值为自身附魔上圣火，下{1}次攻击将额外造成神力值上限{2}的近战伤害
				TameHead: Tame Head|右键召唤残缺灵魂，你和周围{0}格半径敌人防御降低{1}，持续{2}s，且下一次攻击为特殊攻击，附加{3}的额外伤害并必定暴击
				SoulScorching: Soul Scorching|攻击造成{0}s灵魂焰灼烧，敌人受到伤害增加{1}，防御降低{2}
				IndulgentGhost: Indulgent Ghost|每攻击{0}次，将快速发动额外的一次攻击，继承攻击特效
			}
